      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "The ancient city sleeps beneath centuries of mud.\n\n<color=#80FF90>\u2022</color> 
    Walk toward the <color=#80FF90>green beacon lights</color> \u2014 those are buried
    structures.\n<color=#80FF90>\u2022</color>  Press <color=#FFE050>[E]</color>
    near a beacon to begin excavating.\n<color=#80FF90>\u2022</color>  Restore all
    3 buildings to raise your <color=#FFE050>Resonance Score</color>.\n<color=#FF8888>\u2022</color> 
    Mud Golems will attack \u2014 fight or evade them.\n<color=#88AAFF>\u2022</color> 
    Press <color=#FFE050>[T]</color> to open the Frequency Tuner.\n<color=#88AAFF>\u2022</color> 
    A presence watches from the shadows..."
